+        "Track B: the paper's Proposition 3 gives the standard O(r*m^2+n) "
+        "root-matrix inspection and transformation-propagation algorithm, "
+        "measured at 73,936 bit/edge operations and under 0.01 seconds for "
+        "shipping n=240, r=32, m=48; the checksum route uses 271 exact word, "
