+        "Candidates obey every displayed parent-child transformation implication; "
+        "there is one freely chosen A/B letter per root, so the bounded language "
+        "has 2^roots words."
+    ),
+    "bounds": {
+        "alphabet": ["A", "B"],
+        "shipping_length": 240,
